---
import type { Database } from '../data/types';
interface Props { db: Database }
const { db } = Astro.props;
const first = db.tables.find((table) => table.kind === 'table');
const descriptor = `https://ovdb.demodb.dev/v1/databases/${encodeURIComponent(db.id)}`;
const curl = `curl --fail --silent --show-error '${descriptor}'`;
const schema = `curl --fail --silent --show-error '${db.canonicalUrl}schema.json'`;
const model = db.model.modelspec ?? db.model.hcl;
---
<section class="shell section developer-quickstart" id="developers"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Build with this dataset</p><h2>Start from the contract.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/downloads/#research">Get a pinned research snapshot →</a></div>
 <div class="quickstart-grid"><article><h3>Discover the read-only API</h3>{db.ovdb.available ? <><p>Read the current descriptor and inspect its capabilities before choosing a query endpoint. A live response can change independently of the pinned downloads.</p><pre class="query-code"><code id="api-quickstart">{curl}</code></pre><button type="button" class="copy-button" data-copy-target="api-quickstart">Copy API request</button><p><a class="text-link" href={`https://demodb.dev/ovdb/db/${db.id}/`}>Edition and access details →</a></p></> : <p>A verified public API is not published for this edition. Use its checked downloads.</p>}</article>
 <article><h3>Read schema and meanings</h3><p>Schema JSON describes native tables, fields and declared keys. ModelSpec and MeaningGraph add logical entities and field bindings; they do not enforce SQL constraints.</p><pre class="query-code"><code id="schema-quickstart">{schema}</code></pre><button type="button" class="copy-button" data-copy-target="schema-quickstart">Copy schema request</button><p>{model && <a class="text-link" href={`/model/${model.split('/').at(-1)}`}>ModelSpec contract →</a>} · <a class="text-link" href="/model/">MeaningGraph bindings →</a></p>{first && <p><a class="text-link" href={`/tables/${encodeURIComponent(first.name)}/#schema`}>Inspect {first.name} and its mapped fields →</a></p>}</article></div>
</section>
<style>.quickstart-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:32px}.quickstart-grid article{min-width:0}.quickstart-grid p{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}.query-code{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;background:var(--code-surface);padding:18px;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--cyan)}@media(max-width:800px){.quickstart-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
